Description: make PDFs smaller
 PDF Minify makes PDFs smaller with a variety of filters, compression
 algorithms and techniques, and extensive previews that give a quick
 overview of each one's visual effect and file size. Every preview and
 size is the actual file you would save.
 .
 The package carries its own copy of the libraries the release lacks or
 ships too old, such as PyMuPDF, in /usr/lib/pdf-minify.
